<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Microsystems cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Microsystems cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Sun Microsystems Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Sun Microsystems posted fourth quarter earnings of $0.61 a share, up from $0.31 a share a year ago. The First Call consensus was $0.59 a share.</p>
<p>-- Sun Microsystems lost 1-5/16 to 44-1/4.</p>
